465
00:39:54,056 --> 00:39:57,056
なんでお気に入りなんですか？
Why is this one your favorite?

466
00:39:57,056 --> 00:40:01,376
こう… 呪物を集める…
Well... collecting cursed objects...

467
00:40:00,064 --> 00:40:01,264
呪物を集める
Collecting cursed objects...

