渡したあなたでせーの Ruff Ruff Ruff Ruff
From me to you, ready, set: Ruff Ruff Ruff Ruff!

656
00:50:44,080 --> 00:50:46,080
これはド派手にご苦労様
What a showy standard of hard work!

657
