ひらりひらり ここわの層
Lightly, delicately, layers of words...

659
00:50:52,280 --> 00:50:55,080
ふわりふわり そこ連勝
Softly, gently, a winning streak right there...

660
00:50:55,280 --> 00:50:57,880
それでつまり 治めなくちゃ
So in short, I've got to keep control...

661
00:50:58,080 --> 00:51:00,880
衝動的リアル 笑顔で Up-Up
Impulsive reality, with a smile, Up-Up!

662
00:51:09,080 --> 00:51:13,280
歌い出す 秘密の彼
Sing out, the secret lover...

663
00:51:13,380 --> 00:51:17,080
終わることのない この世界
This world that never ends...

664
00:51:17,280 --> 00:51:21,880
悲しい子供は 虚しい子供は
Sad children, empty children...

665
00:51:22,080 --> 00:51:26,580
眠らせて
Put them to sleep...

666
00:51:34,080 --> 00:51:38,280
おままごと 遊びましょう 笑顔で Up-Up
Playing house, let us play, with a smile, Up-Up!

667
00:51:38,880 --> 00:51:41,580
ひらりひらり 女の子
Lightly, delicately, a girl fluttering...

668
00:51:41,680 --> 00:51:44,580
ふわりふわり 言葉の層
Softly, gently, layers of words...

669
00:51:44,680 --> 00:51:47,580
それでつまり 治めなくちゃ
So in short, I've got to keep control...

670
00:51:47,680 --> 00:51:50,580
感情的リアル 笑顔で Up-Up
Emotional reality, with a smile, Up-Up!

671
00:51:58,580 --> 00:52:01,880
遊びましょう 笑顔で Up-Up
Let us play, with a smile, Up-Up!

672
00:52:03,080 --> 00:52:05,580
Up-Up

673
00:52:11,280 --> 00:52:13,280
星川～！
Hoshikawa~!

674
00:52:13,280 --> 00:52:17,580
誕生祭おめでとう！ありがとう来てくれて！
Happy Birthday Festival! Thank you for coming!

675
00:52:17,580 --> 00:52:18,580
ありがとう！
Thank you!

676
00:52:18,580 --> 00:52:24,080
なんとね、2021年の、4年ぶりに…
Can you believe it, for the first time in 4 years since 2021...

677
00:52:24,080 --> 00:52:26,880
出てくれました！
...she appeared here with me!

678
00:52:26,880 --> 00:52:29,080
「チューリングラブ」だったの覚えてる？
Do you remember it was "Turing Love"?

679
00:52:29,080 --> 00:52:30,880
覚えてるよ！4年前に！
I remember! Four years ago!

680
00:52:30,880 --> 00:52:33,080
そう！あん時はね、若かった…
Yeah! Back then, we were so young...

681
00:52:33,080 --> 00:52:35,080
え、今はなんか違う？
Eh, is it different now?

682
00:52:35,080 --> 00:52:37,080
いや、でもクールになったんだよね！
No, but we've gotten cooler!

683
00:52:37,080 --> 00:52:39,580
我々今日、ね、クール可愛かったもんね！
Today we were cool and cute, right?

684
00:52:39,580 --> 00:52:43,080
確かにね、いつもの「チューリングラブ」こんなことしてたよね？
True! For "Turing Love", we did something like this, right?

685
00:52:43,080 --> 00:52:46,080
なんか、オタ芸とかしてたからね！
Yeah, we were doing wota-gei and stuff!

686
00:52:46,080 --> 00:52:49,080
こんなことしてたのに、だいぶクールになりました。
Even though we did that back then, we've become quite cool.

687
00:52:49,080 --> 00:52:51,080
どうしたの？
What happened?

688
00:52:51,080 --> 00:52:53,080
ちょっと…
A bit...

689
00:52:53,080 --> 00:52:56,080
リアルすぎるだろ！
That's way too realistic!

690
00:52:56,080 --> 00:52:58,080
どういうこと？
What's that supposed to mean?

691
00:52:58,080 --> 00:53:00,880
わかんないよ！写真とか…あ、そうね！
I don't know! Like taking photos... Oh right!

692
00:53:00,880 --> 00:53:07,080
今日ね、歌った「モエチャッカファイア」ね、歌ってみた動画も出してるので、ぜひ見てください！
Today we sang "Moe Chakka Fire", and we also released a cover video of it, so please check it out!

693
00:53:07,080 --> 00:53:09,280
え、なんでこの曲にしてくれたんですか？
Eh, why did you choose this song?

694
00:53:09,280 --> 00:53:11,280
えー、これ歌いたかった！
Ah, because I really wanted to sing it!

695
00:53:11,280 --> 00:53:17,080
やっぱね、歌ってみたも出したし、誕生祭でもね、一緒に歌いたいなと思って選びました！
Well, since we released a cover of it, I wanted to sing it together in my birthday stream too, so I picked it!

696
00:53:17,080 --> 00:53:19,880
おー！なんか意外な選曲だった、個人的には。
Oooh! Personally, I felt it was a surprisingly unexpected song choice.

697
00:53:19,880 --> 00:53:22,580
え、本当？なんか今回ホラーライブがテーマなんだけど、
Really? Well, this time the theme is "Horror Live",

698
00:53:22,580 --> 00:53:26,080
どんなコンセプトのライブ？！見たことない！
What kind of concept live is that?! I've never seen that before!

699
00:53:27,080 --> 00:53:30,080
ちょっと合うかなと思って。
I thought it would fit well.

700
00:53:30,080 --> 00:53:32,280
ああ、なるほどね！ちょっと落ち着いててね。
Ah, I see! Being a bit calm and subdued.

701
00:53:32,280 --> 00:53:34,580
なんか、一緒に写真とか撮る？
Should we take some photos together?

702
00:53:34,580 --> 00:53:36,580
撮る！撮る！ってかすごいマジでライブステージ！
Let's do it! Let me tell you, this live stage is seriously amazing!

703
00:53:36,580 --> 00:53:40,080
ねー！めちゃかわいい！
Right?! It's super cute!

704
00:53:40,080 --> 00:53:44,080
え、なんかいいポーズ…やりたいポーズある？まずは普通な？
Eh, any good poses... Any pose you want to do? First a normal one?

705
00:53:44,080 --> 00:53:47,080
まずね！イエーイ！
First, yeah! Yay!

706
00:53:48,080 --> 00:53:51,080
パシャ！え、かわいい！パシャパシャ！
*Snap!* Eh, cute! *Snap snap!*

707
00:53:51,880 --> 00:53:56,080
きっと撮ってくれてるでしょう！
I'm sure everyone is taking screenshots!

708
00:53:56,080 --> 00:53:58,080
あとは？ハート？
What else? A heart?

709
00:53:58,080 --> 00:54:00,580
ハート？ハート作っとく？
A heart? Should we make a heart?

710
00:54:00,580 --> 00:54:03,080
出来てる？
Are we doing it right?

711
00:54:03,080 --> 00:54:06,080
いい感じー！いい感じー！
Looks good~! Looks good~!

712
00:54:06,080 --> 00:54:07,580
にょき！
Nyoki!

713
00:54:08,580 --> 00:54:10,580
にょきにょき！
Nyoki nyoki!

714
00:54:10,580 --> 00:54:12,080
あとは？
What else?

715
00:54:12,080 --> 00:54:15,580
えーあと何だろう？なんかでかくね…あ、これこれこれ！
Hmm, what else? Something big... Oh, this one, this one!

716
00:54:15,580 --> 00:54:17,580
やだー！
No way!

717
00:54:18,080 --> 00:54:22,080
うわー！
Woah!

718
00:54:22,080 --> 00:54:25,080
って感じでね！
Something like that!

719
00:54:25,080 --> 00:54:30,080
あれは？4年前にもさ、撮ったさ、ちょっと座ってエモめな…
What about that? The one we took 4 years ago, sitting down to look emotional...

720
00:54:30,080 --> 00:54:33,080
こっちじゃない！みんなの方向いてね！
Not this way! Facing everyone!

721
00:54:35,080 --> 00:54:38,080
あ、いい！いいじゃん！
Ah, good! That's nice!

722
00:54:38,080 --> 00:54:41,580
4年前もこれで撮ったんだよ！
We took a picture like this four years ago, too!

723
00:54:41,580 --> 00:54:44,580
イエーイ！みんな見てる～？
Yay! Is everyone watching~?

724
00:54:44,580 --> 00:54:46,580
久しぶりの星ちゃまー！
Hoshi-chama after so long~!

725
00:54:46,580 --> 00:54:49,080
衣装も変わってね！
Our outfits changed, too!

726
00:54:49,080 --> 00:54:52,080
本当だね、2人とも衣装変わった！
That's true, both of our outfits changed!

727
00:54:52,080 --> 00:54:55,080
ねぇ、めちゃ可愛いその衣装！しかもめちゃ脚…
Hey, that outfit is super cute! Plus, your legs...

728
00:54:55,080 --> 00:54:59,080
これはでも間違え…脚フェチに向けた衣装だから！いや、そっちじゃない！
Well, this outfit was made for leg fetishists after all! No, not that!

729
00:55:00,688 --> 00:55:02,888
結構隠してるけど...
It's mostly covered up, but...

730
00:55:02,888 --> 00:55:04,288
いやいや、この脚よ！
No, no, look at these legs!

731
00:55:04,288 --> 00:55:06,588
違う、隠してるのが逆にいいんだって！
No, being covered up makes it even better!

732
00:55:06,588 --> 00:55:08,588
あ、そういうこと？チラ見えのね。
Ah, is that it? The sneaky peek-a-boo look.

733
00:55:08,588 --> 00:55:10,588
わかってないなー。
You really don't get it.

734
00:55:10,888 --> 00:55:13,588
やばい、画角やばい！
Oh no, this camera angle is crazy!

735
00:55:14,588 --> 00:55:17,088
だいぶな画角じゃなかったよ。
That was quite an extreme camera angle.

736
00:55:18,088 --> 00:55:20,588
絶対領域がね...
That absolute territory, right...

737
00:55:22,588 --> 00:55:25,288
どう？なんかセクシーポーズとかしなくて大丈夫？
Are you sure you don't need to do a sexy pose?

738
00:55:25,288 --> 00:55:27,288
セクシーポーズ？
A sexy pose?

739
00:55:27,288 --> 00:55:28,288
したいの？
Do you want to?

740
00:55:28,288 --> 00:55:30,588
大丈夫かな？いや、大丈夫です！
Is it okay? No, I'm good!

741
00:55:30,888 --> 00:55:32,288
お誕生日おめでとう！
Happy birthday!

742
00:55:32,288 --> 00:55:33,888
あ、ありがとう！
Ah, thank you!

743
00:55:33,888 --> 00:55:36,288
またね、なんか一緒に歌って踊りたい！
I'd love to sing and dance with you again!

744
00:55:36,288 --> 00:55:38,088
うん！踊ろう、是非！
Yeah! Let me dance with you!

745
00:55:38,088 --> 00:55:40,888
是非ともまた次も踊りましょう！
Let's definitely dance together next time too!

746
00:55:40,388 --> 00:55:42,588
踊りましょう！
Let me dance with you!

747
00:55:43,088 --> 00:55:45,088
じゃあ、バイバーイ！
Well then, bye-bye!

748
00:55:45,088 --> 00:55:47,088
バイバイ！頑張ってね！
Bye-bye! Good luck!

749
00:55:47,088 --> 00:55:49,888
ありがとう！バイバーイ！
Thank you! Bye-bye!

750
00:55:56,288 --> 00:56:00,088
正しくなれない切りがどこをみても
Can't be right, no matter where I look in this fog,

751
00:56:00,088 --> 00:56:04,588
片っ端から確かめたくて
I want to make sure of everything, one by one.

752
00:56:05,288 --> 00:56:10,588
考え続けたい 偽りで出会えた
I want to keep thinking, meeting through fake pretenses,

753
00:56:10,588 --> 00:56:14,288
僕らは何ひとつも 奪われてないから
None of us has had a single thing taken away.

754
00:56:23,088 --> 00:56:26,888
僕ら育っていくみたい
It feels like we are growing up,

755
00:56:26,888 --> 00:56:31,088
愛されるみたい 暖かな波を詠む
as if being loved, reciting the warm waves.

756
00:56:31,588 --> 00:56:34,088
過去か今を選ぶ
Choosing between the past or the present,

757
00:56:34,088 --> 00:56:39,088
澄んだ浅黄色 尋ねる声で何度でも
in a clear light blue voice asking again and again.

758
00:56:39,088 --> 00:56:42,588
僕ら 嘘つきだね
We are liars, aren't we?

759
00:56:42,588 --> 00:56:45,088
両思いだね
Our feelings are mutual, aren't they?

760
00:56:45,088 --> 00:56:48,888
枯れ果てるまで 泣き笑い今日を受け入れてく
Until we wither, we accept today with tears and laughter.

761
00:56:50,888 --> 00:56:56,588
喜び合った日々を 忘れ出しそうだけど
We seem on the verge of forgetting the happy days, but...

762
00:56:57,288 --> 00:57:00,888
知らない方が幸せだって
They say ignorance is bliss,

763
00:57:00,888 --> 00:57:06,088
知れば知れるほど...
but the more I learn, the more...

764
00:57:07,588 --> 00:57:11,288
正しくなれない切りがどこをみても
Can't be right, no matter where I look in this fog,

765
00:57:11,288 --> 00:57:15,888
片っ端から確かめたくて
I want to make sure of everything, one by one.

766
00:57:16,288 --> 00:57:20,088
考え続けたい 偽りで出会えた
I want to keep thinking, meeting through fake pretenses,

767
00:57:20,088 --> 00:57:25,288
僕らは何ひとつも 奪われてないから
None of us has had a single thing taken away.

768
00:57:32,088 --> 00:57:35,088
今心を閉ざすように
As if closing our hearts right now,

769
00:57:35,088 --> 00:57:41,288
粛々と遅れを続けよう 枯れ木に笑顔だけ
let's quietly keep running behind, with only smiles on withered trees.

770
00:57:41,288 --> 00:57:45,088
君の肉体欲しい すべて
I want your physical form, all of it,

771
00:57:45,088 --> 00:57:48,888
無駄になんかさせないよ
I won't let any of it go to waste.

772
00:57:49,088 --> 00:57:53,888
ねぇ 知り得る限り幸せだって
Hey, as far as I can know, even if it's happiness,

773
00:57:53,888 --> 00:57:58,588
たどり着いてもいい...
it's fine even if we reach it...

774
00:58:00,088 --> 00:58:04,588
君だけがみる夕焼け 影かがみ
The sunset only you see, reflected shadow,

775
00:58:04,588 --> 00:58:08,088
僕でもいつかわかる日まで
until the day comes when even I can understand it.

776
00:58:08,588 --> 00:58:12,888
考え続けたい 偽りで会えた
I want to keep thinking, meeting through fake pretenses,

777
00:58:12,888 --> 00:58:17,088
確かになる枝分かれよ 導かれ
dividing branches that become certainty, being guided.

778
00:58:17,088 --> 00:58:21,088
大したもんじゃない 無駄なもんじゃない
It's nothing grand, it's not useless,

779
00:58:21,088 --> 00:58:25,288
潮のりを歓待にしてくように
as if welcoming the salty tide.

780
00:58:25,288 --> 00:58:30,088
ずっと もうずっと 茶化されようが
Forever, forever, even if we are made fun of,

781
00:58:30,088 --> 00:58:32,088
折れない強さは
an unyielding strength...

782
00:58:32,088 --> 00:58:35,088
可能性が
The possibilities...

783
00:58:35,088 --> 00:58:38,088
広げるならば
If they expand...

784
00:58:40,088 --> 00:58:45,588
可能性を 諦められないから
Because I can't give up on the possibilities,

785
00:58:45,588 --> 00:58:48,588
まだ...
Not yet...

786
00:58:52,288 --> 00:58:56,588
正しくなれない切りがどこをみても
Can't be right, no matter where I look in this fog,

787
00:58:56,588 --> 00:59:00,888
片っ端から確かめたくて
I want to make sure of everything, one by one.

788
00:59:01,088 --> 00:59:05,088
考え続けたい 偽りで出会えた
I want to keep thinking, meeting through fake pretenses,

789
00:59:05,088 --> 00:59:09,088
僕らは何ひとつも
None of us has...

790
00:59:09,088 --> 00:59:14,588
すべて嫌われても 奪われてないから
Even if hated by everything, had a single thing taken away.

791
00:59:16,588 --> 00:59:18,588
はあちゃま！
Haachama!

792
00:59:18,888 --> 00:59:21,088
大好きだよ！
I love you so much!

793
00:59:24,588 --> 00:59:26,588
はあちゃま...
Haachama...

794
00:59:26,588 --> 00:59:29,888
はあちゃま、私も大好き！
Haachama, I love you too!

795
00:59:30,088 --> 00:59:31,888
今まで...
Until now...

796
00:59:31,888 --> 00:59:33,288
ごめん！
I'm sorry!

797
00:59:34,088 --> 00:59:36,588
ごめんなさい！
I'm so sorry!

798
00:59:37,088 --> 00:59:39,588
いなくなって...
Leaving you behind...

799
00:59:39,588 --> 00:59:42,588
寂しかったよ...
I was so lonely...

800
00:59:43,088 --> 00:59:47,888
いつも側にいるって言ったじゃん！
You told me you'd always be by my side!

801
00:59:48,588 --> 00:59:52,588
ずっと待ってたよ...
I was waiting for you the whole time...

802
01:00:00,396 --> 01:00:01,396
あ、ちゃま？
Oh, Chama?

803
01:00:01,496 --> 01:00:04,296
あ、ちゃまちゃま！ちゃまだよ〜！
Ah, Chama-chama! It's Chama~!

804
01:00:04,396 --> 01:00:07,196
こうやって対話するの、初めてだよね！
It's our first time talking like this, isn't it!

805
01:00:07,296 --> 01:00:10,196
さっき歌ってた感触、最高だったよー！
Singing together earlier felt amazing!

806
01:00:10,196 --> 01:00:10,896
ありがとう！
Thank you!

807
01:00:10,996 --> 01:00:12,896
なんか大人っぽくなったね！
You've gotten somewhat mature!

808
01:00:13,096 --> 01:00:16,196
実は最近、旅をすることが増えまして…
Actually, I've been traveling more lately...

809
01:00:16,396 --> 01:00:22,596
そこで新しい自分を見つけて、ちょっぴり大人っぽい曲にチャレンジしてみました！
I found a new side of myself there, so I tried challenging a slightly more mature song!

810
01:00:23,096 --> 01:00:26,596
特に好きな歌詞とかはある？
Are there any lyrics you particularly like?

811
01:00:26,796 --> 01:00:32,896
はい。「もう一度もう一度と思いが何度あったでしょう」という歌詞がありまして…
Yes. There's a line that goes, "How many times did I think, 'Just once more, once more'?"...

812
01:00:33,096 --> 01:00:38,896
出会った景色や人の温もりを思いながら、すごく感情移入しました！
While thinking of the sights and human warmth I encountered, I really resonated with it!

813
01:00:39,296 --> 01:00:44,896
そうなんだ！今日リリース予定なので、みんなもたくさん聴いてね！
I see! It's scheduled for release today, so everyone, please listen to it a lot!

814
01:00:45,096 --> 01:00:49,096
そしてぜひぜひ、デュエットで『正しくなれない』歌ったよー！
And we also sang "Can't Be Right" as a duet!

815
01:00:49,296 --> 01:00:50,396
どうだった？
How was it?

816
01:00:50,496 --> 01:00:56,596
今までの記憶とか葛藤を振り返りながらでね、すごく心に沁みましたね。
Looking back on our memories and struggles so far, it really touched my heart.

817
01:00:56,896 --> 01:01:03,596
本当だよー！はぁちゃんはさ、ずっと塞ぎ込んで、全然はあちゃまのこと見向きもしないんだもん！
Really! Ha-chan was moping around for so long, not even looking at Haachama at all!

818
01:01:03,896 --> 01:01:11,596
そんなことないけど…ごめんね。でもお互い知り合って理解し合えたから、良かったなって思うよ。
That's not true, but... I'm sorry. But since we got to know and understand each other, I'm glad.

819
01:01:12,096 --> 01:01:14,296
あ〜、ならいっか！
Ah, guess it's fine then!

820
01:01:14,496 --> 01:01:18,096
そんな2人の家族写真も、今回は撮ってもらいました！
We also had a family photo of the two of us taken this time!

